% this is the DemoA.kps file, it defines the buttons seen on the DemoA Control Panel.
% you can customize this file for whatever your project requires.

button Nbuttons 4        % number of buttons per row
button hspace 4          % horizontal space between buttons
button pos 1
button height 8

button panel DemoA       % set the control panel you want to add buttons to

% add a button with:
% button LABEL ACTION

% LABEL is the label for the button,

% ACTION is a command to execute when the button is clicked, use "nop" (no operation) for labels
% ACTION can be a KnotPlot command, for example "delete all" or an alias "~someAlias",
% or it can run a script, for example "<myScript.kps"


button section "Section Name"

button "my demo" <firstdemo.kps
button second <secondDemo.kps
button "A Third Demo" ~couldBeAnAlias 2x     % button uses two slots
button "cd knot" "knot cd"


button section "Another Section"
button first <firstdemo.kps
button "another great demo" <GreatDemo.kps 3x    % button uses three slots


panel on

